  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n\\text {Velocity on hitting the surface } & =\\sqrt{2 \\times 9.8 \\times 4.9} \\\\\n& =9.8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}\n\\end{aligned}$\nVelocity after first bounce, $v=\\frac{3}{4} \\times 9.8$\nTime taken from first bounce to the second bounce\n$=\\frac{2 v}{g}=2 \\times \\frac{3}{4} \\times 9.8 \\times \\frac{1}{9.8}=1.5 \\mathrm{~s}$",
    "image": null
